    <template id="privacy_policy_hekau" inherit_id="website.privacy_policy" name="Hekau Privacy Policy" priority="99">
        <xpath expr="//div[@id='wrap']" position="replace">
            <div id="wrap" class="oe_structure hk-page">
                <section class="s_hk_service_hero" data-snippet="s_hk_service_hero" data-name="Hekau Service Hero">
                    <div class="hk-hero-art hk-deco o_not_editable" aria-hidden="true">
                        <div class="hk-hero-stage">
                            <span class="hk-hero-ellipse"/>
                            <span class="hk-hero-panel"/>
                        </div>
                        <span class="hk-hero-fade"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hk-container hk-service-hero-content">
                        <div class="hk-eyebrow">
                            <span class="hk-eyebrow-line hk-deco"/>
                            <span class="hk-eyebrow-label">Legal</span>
                            <span class="hk-eyebrow-line hk-eyebrow-line-end hk-deco"/>
                        </div>
                        <h1 class="hk-service-title"><span class="hk-service-title-text">Privacy Policy</span></h1>
                        <p class="hk-service-sub">Last updated October 2026</p>
                        <p class="hk-service-text">What personal data this website collects, why, and the choices you have.</p>
                    </div>
                </section>
                <section class="s_hk_case_text hk-section" data-snippet="s_hk_case_text" data-name="Hekau Case Text" style="--hk-pt: 40px; --hk-pt-m: 24px;">
                    <div class="hk-container hk-container-case hk-case-text">
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">1. Who we are</h2>
                            <p>Hekau Business Solutions Private Limited, Vijayashree, S. No. 33/92, near MSEB Office, Katraj, Pune 411046, Maharashtra, India, decides how your personal data is used on this website. Privacy questions: admin@hekautech.com.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">2. What we collect</h2>
                            <p>From our forms: your name, work email, phone, company, revenue band, the service you’re interested in, your message and how you heard about us. From the newsletter signup: your name and email. When you book a call: the details you enter in the booking calendar, collected through Calendly. Automatically: your IP address, browser and device details, and the pages you visit, through cookies and analytics tools.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">3. Why we use it</h2>
                            <p>To reply to your enquiry and arrange your systems audit; to send the checklist and newsletter if you asked for them; to improve the website; to manage our relationship with clients; and to meet legal obligations.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">4. Your consent</h2>
                            <p>We use your data on the basis of the consent you give in our forms, or for other uses the law allows. You can withdraw consent at any time, as easily as you gave it, by emailing us or using the unsubscribe link in any email.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">5. Cookies</h2>
                            <p>Essential cookies keep the website working. Analytics cookies are set only if you accept them in the cookie banner. The booking calendar is provided by Calendly, which may set its own cookies. You can also block cookies in your browser.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">6. Who we share it with</h2>
                            <p>Service providers that help us run the business, such as hosting, email (Google Workspace), call scheduling (Calendly) and analytics, under contracts that protect your data. We never sell personal data. We disclose it only when the law requires.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">7. Where it’s stored</h2>
                            <p>On servers used by Hekau and its service providers. Some providers may process data outside India, as the law permits.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">8. How long we keep it</h2>
                            <p>Enquiry data, as long as we need it to respond and for any relationship that follows; if no engagement follows, we delete it after 24 months. Newsletter data, until you unsubscribe. Records the law requires us to keep, such as invoices, for the period it sets.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">9. How we protect it</h2>
                            <p>Encryption in transit, access limited by role, two-factor login on our systems, and regular backups.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">10. Your rights</h2>
                            <p>You can ask for a summary of the data we hold about you, have it corrected, completed, updated or erased, withdraw your consent, nominate someone to act for you, and raise a grievance. Email us and we’ll respond within the time the law requires. If you’re not satisfied, you can complain to the Data Protection Board of India.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">11. Children</h2>
                            <p>This website is for businesses and is not directed at anyone under 18. We don’t knowingly collect their data.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">12. Changes</h2>
                            <p>We may update this policy; the date at the top shows the current version.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hk-case-group">
                            <h2 class="hk-case-h2 hk-case-h2-sm">13. Contact for privacy questions and grievances</h2>
                            <p>Santosh Yadav, Director, admin@hekautech.com, +91 81497 49282.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
            </div>
        </xpath>
    </template>

</odoo>
